    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPERPANEL is a first person parkour exploration &amp; trading game set in procedural megastructures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique movement system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading with dynamic economy - prices move based on deals made by you and non playable traders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight of stuff you carry paired with wearing equipment stats affect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your equipment for more efficient deliveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly traps as parts of megastructure\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
